BSIM2 gate-driven charge across threshold
* Provenance: original Sansho R14b circuit.
* sweep: vgs -.2 0 .2 .4 .6 .8 1 1.4 2.2
.param probe=0
Vd d 0 1.5
Vg g 0 {probe} ac 1
Vb b 0 -.25
Vs s 0 0
M1 d g s b dev w=4u l=1.2u
.model dev nmos(level=5 phi=.7 vfb=-.52 k1=.55 k2=.025 tox=.025 mu0=470 ua0=.12 ub0=.02 u10=.1 eta0=.012 vdd=3 temp=27 n0=1.45 xpart=0)
.ac dec 4 10k 100meg
.save i(Vg) i(Vd) i(Vs) i(Vb)
.end
